exams/
quizzes/

# Midterm (take-home, out Thu 13 Aug 2026). The Colab badge and the notebook's
# wget URL point at assessment/... on main, so ON RELEASE DAY: delete the
# `assessment/` line below (the xml-cache line stays), then commit the brief,
# notebook and data. Checklist in assessment/README.md. Until then: never commit.
assessment/
assessment/xml-cache/

# Internal working documents.
*.docx

